#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: keyword
#: jpeglossless.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kipi"
msgstr "Kipi"

#. Tag: title
#: jpeglossless.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "JPEG Loss Less"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This plugin is available from within the host application. It allows (for the "
"below listed transformations) saving images in JPEG format, which usually "
"loses "
"precision every time you save it (otherwise there would be no size "
"reduction), "
"without losing any quality nor metadata information:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless JPEG 90/180/270 Degree Rotation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless JPEG Horizontal or Vertical flip."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless JPEG black and white conversion."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exif orientation tag based rotation or flip auto-adjustment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do lossless recompression of JPEG images."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: jpeglossless.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As a consequence of the lossless storage the file size will be larger "
"(similar "
"to the lossless PNG format) since there's no compression of the color coding "
"information."
msgstr ""

